    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=559684915793232701&sectionId=565251374938326027)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"off_lazy_script"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpODz-G7zy_text","label":"ggpODz-G7zy_text","default":"<p>Still Not Sure?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTGHhyFr2y_text","label":"ggTGHhyFr2y_text","default":"Here Are The Top Questions We Get About MenoMate"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_0","label":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_0","default":"<p>Health</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_1","label":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_1","default":"<p>Product</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_2","label":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_2","default":"<p>Order</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_3","label":"ggV63q3gs8p_childItem_3","default":"<p>Reference</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_0","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_0","default":"<p>When can I experience results from MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_1","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_1","default":"<p>I am on a diet (e.g., <strong>Vegan / Ketogenic / Paleo / Kosher</strong>). Can I still take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_2","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_2","default":"<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>gluten, soy, peanuts, dairy, shellfish</strong> or other common allergens for women?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_3","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_3","default":"<p>Can I take MenoMate if I’m on <strong>medication</strong> or have a health condition?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_4","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_4","default":"<p>Is it safe to take if I'm <strong>pregnant / breastfeeding</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_5","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_5","default":"<p>I have had <strong>estrogen-receptor–positive (ER+) breast cancer</strong>. Can I take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_6","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_6","default":"<p>Can <strong>men</strong> take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_7","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_7","default":"<p>Does MenoMate have any <strong>side effects?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_8","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_8","default":"<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>caffeine</strong> or any other stimulants?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_9","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_9","default":"<p>Is there an <strong>age</strong> restriction?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_10","label":"ggEFxa2qlNj_childItem_10","default":"<p>Is MenoMate<strong> hormone-free?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOiCuW64E6_text","label":"ggOiCuW64E6_text","default":"<p>Results can vary from person to person. Some women notice improvements within 2 weeks, but it usually takes 8–12 weeks for full support. That’s why we recommend trying the 3-bottle bundle, so your body has time to experience the full benefits. Many women report the following:&nbsp;<br>• By <strong>Week 2</strong>: Less hip stiffness, making movement easier&nbsp;<br>• By <strong>Week 4</strong>: Reduced pain, leading to more comfortable walking and light activities&nbsp;<br>• By <strong>Week 8</strong>: Easier to sleep on your side, with more restful nights&nbsp;<br>• By <strong>Week 12</strong>: Feeling stronger, more flexible, and pain-free during daily activities.</p><p><br><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0JbU6NUk9_text","label":"gg0JbU6NUk9_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is made with high-quality, natural ingredients and is free from stimulants, so it’s safe for long-term use. Side effects are rare, but some women might experience mild bloating or digestive changes in the first few days as the probiotics start working. This is normal and should go away quickly. If you have any discomfort, stop taking MenoMate and talk to your doctor. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or on medication, consult your doctor before starting MenoMate. Taking 2 capsules per day as recommended helps minimize side effects and gives you the best results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg36WI1qhWS_text","label":"gg36WI1qhWS_text","default":"<p>Yes! MenoMate is suitable for all these diets. It can support digestion, improve nutrient absorption, and promote overall wellness. Many women on these diets have experienced extra benefits, such as better digestion, weight management, improved mood, and more energy throughout the day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVIY0_eWrg_text","label":"ggVIY0_eWrg_text","default":"<p>If you are on medication, pregnant, breastfeeding, or have a health condition, please consult your doctor before using MenoMate or any supplement. MenoMate contains natural ingredients with anti-inflammatory effects, so it’s important to check with your doctor, especially if you take medications like NSAIDs, blood thinners, or COX-2 inhibitors.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggugvLz-fQx_text","label":"ggugvLz-fQx_text","default":"<p>MenoMate uses 100% natural ingredients and is generally safe for pregnant and breastfeeding women. However, since each pregnancy is different, it’s always best to consult your doctor before starting MenoMate.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXCrZJKR9T_text","label":"ggXCrZJKR9T_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is made with <strong>100% natural, high-quality ingredients</strong> and <strong>does not contain estrogen or synthetic hormones.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, for your safety, we strongly advise <strong>discussing MenoMate with your oncologist or healthcare provider</strong> before starting, so they can assess whether it is appropriate for your situation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your health journey deserves personalized care, and we’re here to support you however we can. If you’d like to share more details or ask questions privately, our Customer Service Team is always ready to listen: support@wellnessnest.co.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW71t3wriw_text","label":"ggW71t3wriw_text","default":"<p>Yes, MenoMate can support men’s health too — especially those experiencing hip pain related to hormonal changes, such as gluteal tendinopathy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While it’s formulated with women’s hormonal and digestive health in mind, its probiotics, anti-inflammatory herbs, and tendon-supportive nutrients can also help men by reducing inflammation, easing joint stiffness, and supporting tendon recovery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Many customers purchase MenoMate for their partners after seeing improvements themselves, and we love hearing how both experience relief and better mobility.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZrKWWKdtB_text","label":"ggZrKWWKdtB_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is <strong>not known to have any major side effects</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MenoMate is made with <strong>high-quality, natural</strong> ingredients and is stimulant-free, making it suitable for long-term daily use. It has been tested for safety and is generally well-tolerated by most women.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While side effects are uncommon, some women may notice mild bloating or digestive changes during the first few days. This is often due to the probiotics in MenoMate beginning to rebalance and support your gut microbiome — a normal, temporary sign that your body is adjusting to the formula — and it usually subsides quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you experience any unusual or persistent discomfort, stop taking MenoMate and consult your healthcare provider. Women who are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or managing a medical condition should speak with their doctor before starting MenoMate.</p><p>Following the recommended dosage of 2 capsules per day can help ensure optimal results while minimizing any potential side effects.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggennx4jpRn_text","label":"ggennx4jpRn_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is <strong>100% caffeine-free and stimulant-free</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MenoMate is completely caffeine-free and stimulant-free. It’s made with natural, high-quality ingredients, and everything is clearly listed on the packaging and website for full transparency. This makes it safe for daily use, so women can enjoy long-term benefits without feeling jittery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZ86PuFR4K_text","label":"ggZ86PuFR4K_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is for women aged 40 and older who are dealing with menopause, perimenopause, or postmenopause. If you’re younger and considering MenoMate, please talk to your doctor first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gVNP3mJVGmW_text","label":"gVNP3mJVGmW_text","default":"<p>Yes, MenoMate is completely hormone-free. It does not contain any estrogen or synthetic hormones. Instead, MenoMate uses 100% natural, high-quality ingredients like probiotics, turmeric, and black cohosh to support your body during menopause, helping to manage symptoms without relying on hormones. Always consult with your doctor if you have specific health concerns or are taking medications before starting any new supplement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_0","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_0","default":"<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>FDA-approved</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_1","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_1","default":"<p>What is the <strong>recommended dosage </strong>for MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_2","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_2","default":"<p>How does the formula <strong>taste</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_3","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_3","default":"<p>Can I <strong>open the capsules and mix</strong> the powder into food or drinks?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_4","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_4","default":"<p>How long does one bottle last?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_5","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_5","default":"<p>What are the exact <strong>ingredients </strong>that go into MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_6","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_6","default":"<p>How big are the capsules?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_7","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_7","default":"<p>Do I have to keep MenoMate in the fridge?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_8","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_8","default":"<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>manufactured</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_9","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_9","default":"<p>What if MenoMate doesn't work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_10","label":"gg5AL8IJvqi_childItem_10","default":"<p>Why choose this product over others?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggO03HDulqe_text","label":"ggO03HDulqe_text","default":"<p>By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">Every batch of MenoMate is verified by Eurofins (the global leader in pharmaceutical testing) with a </span><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/products/menomate?selling_plan=9640935739#gsQk86ZiSq\"><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong><u>Certificate of Analysis (CoA)</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> to ensure:</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Exact labeled amounts</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – No underdosing or overdosing.</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>High purity</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – Free from contaminants like heavy metals or microbes.</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Accurate identity</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – Correct plant species, probiotic strains, and active compounds.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYjCa6P9-0_text","label":"ggYjCa6P9-0_text","default":"<p>For best results, take <strong>2 capsules each morning</strong> before breakfast with a glass of water.</p><p>If you’ve recently completed a course of antibiotics or feel you need extra digestive and hormonal support, you may take up to <strong>4 capsules daily</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZdVI-sJyo_text","label":"ggZdVI-sJyo_text","default":"<p>MenoMate comes in easy-to-swallow capsules with the <strong>natural scent of turmeric</strong> — a sign of its purity and potency. Turmeric is well known for supporting a healthy inflammatory response, so that natural aroma means you’re getting the real thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-KthtnTFT_text","label":"gg-KthtnTFT_text","default":"<p>We don’t recommend it. MenoMate uses <strong>EMBO Caps®</strong> — a special plant-based capsule that helps deliver the ingredients right where your body can absorb them best. Opening them could reduce their effectiveness, so you’ll get the most benefits by taking them whole.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxj_LhJ8sN_text","label":"ggxj_LhJ8sN_text","default":"<p>Each bottle contains 60 capsules—enough for <strong>30 days</strong> when taking 2 capsules per day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggERnCMMrZ8_text","label":"ggERnCMMrZ8_text","default":"<p><strong>Probiotics</strong> (10 Billion CFU): Bifidobacterium animalis subsp. lactis, Bifidobacterium breve, Lactobacillus gasseri</p><p><strong>Natural Herbs &amp; Extracts</strong>: Turmeric Root Extract (Curcuma longa L.) – 350 mg, Curry Leaf Extract – 50 mg, Black Cohosh Powder Extract – 40 mg, Di-Indolylmethane (DIM) – 40 mg, Moringa Leaf Extract – 35 mg</p><p><strong>Absorption Boosters</strong>: BioPerine® Organic Black Pepper Extract – 3 mg</p><p><strong>Prebiotic Fiber</strong>: Inulin (from Chicory root) – 337.5 mg</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZTyMeiaHt_text","label":"ggZTyMeiaHt_text","default":"<p>MenoMate capsules are compact and easy to take — each is about <strong>0.9 inches long</strong>, just a little bigger than a long grain of rice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If swallowing capsules isn’t your favorite thing, try taking <strong>one at a time</strong> instead of both together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFfhOv3BK9_text","label":"ggFfhOv3BK9_text","default":"<p>Nope — MenoMate is designed to be hassle-free. The probiotics we use naturally thrive at room temperature, so you can store your bottle in a cupboard or on your counter without worry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each batch is <strong>shelf-stable for up to 2 years</strong> after delivery. For best results, keep it in a <strong>cool, dry spot</strong> —preferably below 77°F (25°C). Avoid direct sunlight or extreme heat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggt3MiMlme3_text","label":"ggt3MiMlme3_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is made in a GMP-certified, FDA-registered factory in the USA. We follow the highest safety and quality standards for every batch.me</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggz5bk3wfSY_text","label":"ggz5bk3wfSY_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a<strong> refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoYy_-I6tt_text","label":"ggoYy_-I6tt_text","default":"<p>MenoMate targets <strong>root hormonal imbalances</strong> with carefully measured, science-backed extracts (like Black Cohosh, DIM, and probiotics) that specifically address menopausal issues. We also offer a <strong>90-day money-back guarantee,</strong> so you can try it risk-free.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_0","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is my credit card information secure?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_1","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_1","default":"<p>Do you ship <strong>worldwide</strong> (e.g., Canada, Australia)?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_2","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_2","default":"<p>How does <strong>free shipping</strong> work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_3","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_3","default":"<p>How do I track my package?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_4","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_4","default":"<p>I didn’t receive a shipping or order confirmation. Help!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_5","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is this a <strong>one-time</strong> purchase?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_6","label":"gg7f5wy67aY_childItem_6","default":"<p>How does the <strong>90-Day Money-Back Guarantee </strong>work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiDFJlrNKk_text","label":"ggiDFJlrNKk_text","default":"<p>Yes! Your payment details are protected with <strong>bank-level encryption (SSL)</strong> and <strong>PCI-DSS compliance</strong> (the highest security standard). We never store or access your full credit card information—your data stays safe at every step.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN48gJcTCm_text","label":"ggN48gJcTCm_text","default":"<p>Yes! We ship MenoMate worldwide — no matter where you are, we’ll deliver straight to your door. Enjoy <strong>free shipping</strong> on all orders over $70. For orders under this amount, shipping fees are based on your location and will be automatically calculated at checkout after you enter your delivery address.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9_kTJy-2B_text","label":"gg9_kTJy-2B_text","default":"<p>We provide <strong>free shipping</strong> on all MenoMate orders over $70. For orders under $70, the shipping cost is determined by your location and will be shown instantly at checkout after you enter your delivery address.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpZLGxJMF1_text","label":"ggpZLGxJMF1_text","default":"<p>Tracking information should have been sent to you via email when you placed your order. If you didn’t receive it, send us an email at support@wellnessnest.co.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs3BLkBF0t_text","label":"ggs3BLkBF0t_text","default":"<p>Don’t worry — just email us at support@wellnessnest.co, and our team will quickly help you track down your order details and make sure everything is on its way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF9A90QQ62_text","label":"ggF9A90QQ62_text","default":"<p>It depends on the option you choose at checkout. You can purchase MenoMate as a <strong>one-time order</strong> with no recurring charges, or you can choose our <strong>subscription plan</strong> and save <strong>10%</strong> on every order.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Subscribers also enjoy automatic deliveries at your chosen frequency, so you never run out.</p><p>You can modify, pause, or cancel your subscription anytime through your account.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now#gdEXummUtM</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTLE-0vEuO_text","label":"ggTLE-0vEuO_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a<strong> refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy8OLYMeFm_text","label":"ggy8OLYMeFm_text","default":"<p><strong>1. Johns Hopkins Medicine</strong>: https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/wellness-and-prevention/turmeric-benefits</p><p><strong>2. Idyl</strong>: https://www.idyl.co.in/blogs/blog/unlock-the-heart-healthy-secrets-of-curry-leaves</p><p><strong>3. Journal of Midwifery &amp; Women's Health</strong>: https://journals.lww.com/jomh/fulltext/2024/15010/exploring_the_efficacy_and_safety_of_black_cohosh.3.aspx</p><p><strong>4. PMC</strong>: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9881416/</p><p><strong>5. PubMed</strong>: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16552838/</p><p><strong>6. Medical News Today</strong>: https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/317530</p><p><strong>7. Harvard Health Publishing</strong>: https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/turmeric-benefits-a-look-at-the-evidence</p><p><strong>8. NDTV</strong>: https://www.ndtv.com/food/diabetes-how-curry-leaves-kadi-patta-help-manage-blood-sugar-levels-1949847</p><p><strong>9. NIH</strong>: https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/BlackCohosh-HealthProfessional/</p><p><strong>10. WebMD</strong>: https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-662/turmeric</p><p><strong>11. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/curry-leaves-benefits</p><p><strong>12. Mount Sinai</strong>: https://www.mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/black-cohosh</p><p><strong>13. Mayo Clinic</strong>: https://newsnetwork.mayoclinic.org/discussion/mayo-clinic-minute-are-there-health-benefits-to-taking-turmeric/</p><p><strong>14. Healthline</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-10-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-turmeric\">https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-10-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-turmeric</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gdEXummUtM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7YbHtGeov_text","label":"gg7YbHtGeov_text","default":"<p><strong>Still have questions?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMHlXW4iey_text","label":"ggMHlXW4iey_text","default":"<p>Contact our support team at</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBaadbbxRb_text","label":"ggBaadbbxRb_text","default":"<p>support@wellnessnest.co</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggX7ULk3Zmd_text","label":"ggX7ULk3Zmd_text","default":"<p>or check out our <strong>Help Center</strong> for more details We're here to help you conquer menopause naturally!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKkBZHcQ-B_text","label":"ggKkBZHcQ-B_text","default":"Dont Let Menopause Control Your Life"},{"type":"html","id":"gguLd